          "text": "Description: On May 16, 1978, at 21:15, two individuals observed in the sky a spherical object moving very quickly in a north-northwest direction. This object was of very intense luminosity. No other testimony regarding this phenomenon was collected. These witnesses likely observed the high-altitude passage of a sunlit aircraft.",
